      "sequence": 8664,
      "chapter_label": "2SA 23",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2SA",
        "chapter": 23,
        "verse": 10
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "He arose and struck the Philistines until his hand was weary, and his hand froze to the sword; and the LORD worked a great victory that day; and the people returned after him only to take plunder.",
      "ko": "저가 나가서 손이 피곤하여 칼에 붙기까지 블레셋 사람을 치니라 그 날에 여호와께서 크게 이기게 하셨으므로 백성들은 돌아와서 저의 뒤를 따라가며 노략할 뿐이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "aec2399c9a071f29e2e32b3b0039a0a22c49b62d4ef8905192374f718b3dc6f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "a06a51cdd25970cec37b6a46a4223e35714d015ee23e8c6d229c12f7101e53de",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
