        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "After him was Shammah the son of Agee, a Hararite. The Philistines had gathered together into a troop where there was a plot of ground full of lentils; and the people fled from the Philistines.",
      "ko": "그 다음은 하랄 사람 아게의 아들 삼마라 블레셋 사람이 떼를 지어 녹두나무가 가득한 밭에 모이매 백성들은 블레셋 사람 앞에서 도망하되",
      "source_text_hash": "adff69e530bebc7744c6d41c7611e46ea01f577d5e25df8756da9c5a6c52d375",
      "translation_text_hash": "2ac75dea491e7a6a926060dae1cbc21965a1b2f040ea25b70223b2a25b6151c2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
