      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "But he stood in the middle of the plot and defended it, and killed the Philistines; and the LORD worked a great victory.",
      "ko": "저는 그 밭 가운데 서서 막아 블레셋 사람을 친지라 여호와께서 큰 구원을 이루시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2ddc19e73fdba5029a74f4ad4112bf402ab142fa3e80235fd3ca1cb4c26d0071",
      "translation_text_hash": "ed84c2d757bc523f2aa0d588ec4a47e61b93e823b74a079b0e110ad8f233d184",
