      "en": "David was then in the stronghold; and the garrison of the Philistines was then in Bethlehem.",
      "ko": "그 때에 다윗은 산성에 있고 블레셋 사람의 영채는 베들레헴에 있는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "817896f1950b87a4b7e29197cdaac0cb64e33a53809133ea3e52213e27506b93",
