      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 23,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "Abishai, the brother of Joab, the son of Zeruiah, was chief of the three. He lifted up his spear against three hundred and killed them, and had a name among the three.",
      "ko": "또 스루야의 아들 요압의 아우 아비새니 저는 그 삼인의 두목이라 저가 창을 들어 삼백인을 죽이고 그 삼인 중에 이름을 얻었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "00a66a651cd40ba57fafbd8ada7df27019de1068d97006215c0bec6f3313c130",
      "translation_text_hash": "636153d1f18d153ff734c101c997d7e3350b29c00a4e6235830695349f7a9961",
